NAME
	preprocess_file - process a file with the LPC preprocessor

SYNOPSIS
	string *preprocess_file(string file, string source...)


DESCRIPTION
	Preprocess the given file.  If the optional source argument is
	supplied, the concatenation of those strings is preprocessed, instead.
	The returned array contains the preprocessed output.

ERRORS
	Preprocessing errors will be reported to the driver object.
	Furthermore, a failure to preprocess will result in a runtime error, as
	well.

SEE ALSO
	kfun/compile_object
